    <mxCell id="n1" value="Cardinality notes:
• MapDto &#x27;owns&#x27; Tilesets/Layers/Events.
• Layers are parallel arrays matching Width*Height.
• Collision layer is a conventional layerId &#x27;col&#x27;
  for compatibility across editor/runtime.
• Events are sparse (only stored when present)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
